# Legacy non-root routes → canonical localized routes (301).
# `/` is intentionally served as the DEC-019 language gateway so an explicit
# saved choice/browser preference can select the initial localized route.
# UX U8: the unprefixed /about /contact /privacy /security /support /products
# have NO rule here on purpose. They are static locale gateways (saved choice >
# browser language > country hint > en, client-side) so a Vietnamese visitor is
# not forced to /en/. Canonical stays /en/...; no-JS falls back to /en/.
# Guarded by tests/architecture/redirect-contract.test.mjs.
# NOTE: never use a greedy `/products/*` rule: redirects run before static
# assets, so it would 301 /products/<slug>/icon.png, showcase video, subtitles
# etc. to HTML. `:slug` matches exactly one path segment (no `/`), so only
# legacy page URLs are redirected. Guarded by
# tests/architecture/redirects-asset-safety.test.mjs.
# (Workers Static Assets honors this file; builds also emit meta-refresh
# stubs as a fallback for hosts that do not read _redirects.)
/products/sotro/ /vi/products/sotro/ 301
/products/sotro /vi/products/sotro/ 301
/products/sotam/ /en/products/sotam/ 301
/products/sotam /en/products/sotam/ 301
/products/:slug/ /en/products/ 301
/products/:slug /en/products/ 301
# RT-03: explicit one-hop 301s for the no-slash forms so the platform's
# 307 trailing-slash normalization never chains into the 301 above
# (remaining product-slug rules and bare locale roots).
# Exact-match only (no splat/placeholder); same-origin destinations only.
# Guarded by tests/architecture/rt03-single-hop-redirects.test.mjs.
/en /en/ 301
/vi /vi/ 301
/zh /zh/ 301
/zh-hant /zh-hant/ 301
# Retired "How this site is built" page (Owner 2026-10-11). Its public-claim
# role lives on /verify; one permanent hop, exact matches only.
/en/architecture/ /en/verify/ 301
/en/architecture /en/verify/ 301
/vi/architecture/ /vi/verify/ 301
/vi/architecture /vi/verify/ 301
/zh/architecture/ /zh/verify/ 301
/zh/architecture /zh/verify/ 301
/zh-hant/architecture/ /zh-hant/verify/ 301
/zh-hant/architecture /zh-hant/verify/ 301
